#4200
Within the Vortex~
You are floating within a shimmering silver vortex, that spirals upwards
from here. The vortex is quite wide, and the central portion you have
fortunately stumbled into, is calm. You feel somehow seperated from the
natural world, even though you can still see the tunnel behind you.
~
42 2097216 0 0 0 9 255 0
D2
You can still see the tunnel behind you through the swirling vortex.
~
~
0 0 20819
D4
The vortex extends far above you, the end far out of sight... seemingly
infinitely distant.
~
~
0 -1 4201
E
rainbow~
The rainbow softly glows with beams of light, in colors that defy 
description.
~
S
#4201
Within the Vortex~
You are floating in a strange silvery vortex, surrounded by many beams of
light reflecting from its rapidly moving boundary. Through the bottom,
you can still make out the edge of the tunnel through which you passed,
although it is now quite far away.
~
42 2097152 0 0 0 9 255 0
D4
The vortex extends far above you, slowly fading into darkness.
~
~
