#4204
Within the Vortex~
You are nearing the end of the Vortex. The silvery beams of light have
begun to merge and solidify. You can now see glowing starlike motes of
dust all around you, while up ahead you see a strange bridge.
~
42 2097152 0 0 0 9 255 0
D4
